    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "The surface plot shows the whole solution $u(x, t)$ from the series truncated at $n = 39$. The peak flattens fastest at the start, while the high modes are still present.",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "heat_surface : sum(bn_heat[k]*exp(-alpha_v*%pi^2*k^2*t)*sin(k*%pi*x), k, 1, 39)$\nax_draw3d(explicit(heat_surface, x, 0, 1, t, 0, 0.25),\n  colorscale = \"Viridis\", title = \"Heat Equation u(x, t)\",\n  xlabel = \"x\", ylabel = \"t\", zlabel = \"u\")$",
