    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "## The Vibrating String [S]\n\nPress play to watch one period of the string. The animation draws the Fourier series truncated at 60 terms. The two corners run apart, reflect from the ends upside down, and meet again at $t = 1$ and $t = 2$.",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "bn_wave : float(map(lambda([k], subst([n = k, a = 1, p = p_v], b_wave)), makelist(k, k, 1, 60)))$\nwave_series : sum(bn_wave[k]*cos(k*%pi*c_v*t)*sin(k*%pi*x), k, 1, 60)$\nax_draw2d(\n  color = \"steelblue\", line_width = 3, nticks = 101,\n  animate(explicit(wave_series, x, 0, 1), [t, 0, 2, 61]),\n  xrange = [0, 1], yrange = [-1.1, 1.1],\n  title = \"Plucked String\", xlabel = \"x\", ylabel = \"u\",\n  slider_label = \"t\", showlegend = false)$",
      "metadata": {},
      "execution_count": 19,
      "outputs": [
